.TH LIGINT-GUI 1 "" "ligint @VERSION@" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ligint\-gui \- graphical interface of ligint
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ligint\-gui
.RI [ structure ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B ligint\-gui
opens a PDB or mmCIF file, lists its ligands and shows the non-covalent interactions of the chosen ligand in a 3D view,
in tables and as an interaction fingerprint.
Thresholds, options, chemical templates (SDF or MOL2) and a pocket definition for the fingerprint can be set from the window.
.PP
After every analysis the
.B ligint
command line that reproduces it is written in the Log tab and can be copied with
.BR "File > Copy command line" .
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.I structure
PDB or mmCIF file to open at start (optional).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR ligint (1)
.PP
The user manual opens from the Help menu (F1); its HTML files are in
.IR /usr/share/doc/ligint/manual/ .
.SH AUTHORS
The ligint authors.
